er kittens. Ummmm….YES????</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/SVJuc8t.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>The kittens are not at the humane society yet, she just needed to find a foster first.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/23PivGq.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>She thought it was six, but it’s only four. But FOUR NEW KITTENS?? Yes please!!</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/7OkdM6p.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>I shall very much miss Dusty Bottoms, Ned Nederlander, and Lucky Day but they’re going to be living their best lives in Colorado and that means I can open my doors and heart to these new kittens!</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/WpyMQUC</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[KittensForDays]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>I Feel Them Taking Over…</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/trWhn5a</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/8uIIo9P.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>This is basically me whenever I find a loose cosplay item about the house… they all call to me “put on the bunny suit… wear the maid uniform… become Mara Jade again.”

